{"content":[{"c":["STRONG DRINK"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Any intoxicating liquor. It was forbidden to Levites who were entering the tent of meeting (",{"href":"?bref=Lev.10.9","r":"Lev.10.9","rawR":"Lev.10.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.10.9","value":"Lev.10.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lv 10:9"},"); to those taking the Nazirite vow (",{"href":"?bref=Num.6.3","r":"Num.6.3","rawR":"Num.6.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.6.3","value":"Num.6.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 6:3"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.13.4-14","r":"Judg.13.4-14","rawR":"Judg.13.4-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.13.4-14","value":"Judg.13.4-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 13:4-14"},"); to kings and rulers (",{"href":"?bref=Pr.31.4","r":"Pr.31.4","rawR":"Pr.31.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.31.4","value":"Pr.31.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Prv 31:4"},"); and to John the Baptist (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.1.15","r":"Luke.1.15","rawR":"Luke.1.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.1.15","value":"Luke.1.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 1:15"},"). The writer of ",{"href":"?bref=Pr.20.1","r":"Pr.20.1","rawR":"Pr.20.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.20.1","value":"Pr.20.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Proverbs 20:1"}," suggests that the wise man does not become intoxicated by it. Isaiah pronounces woe on those addicted to it (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.5.11,22","r":"Isa.5.11,22","rawR":"Isa.5.11,22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.5.11,22","value":"Isa.5.11,22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 5:11, 22"},"). Strong drink was used as a libation in the Levitical sacrifice (",{"href":"?bref=Num.28.7","r":"Num.28.7","rawR":"Num.28.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.28.7","value":"Num.28.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 28:7"},") and was permitted in the menu of the feast at the time of tithing (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.14.26","r":"Deut.14.26","rawR":"Deut.14.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.14.26","value":"Deut.14.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 14:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Wine_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Wine_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Wine_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Wine"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"StrongDrink","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Lv 10:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lev.10.9","rawQueryValue":"Lev.10.9","sourceRefExact":"Lev.10.9"},{"anchorText":"Nm 6:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.6.3","rawQueryValue":"Num.6.3","sourceRefExact":"Num.6.3"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 13:4-14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.13.4-14","rawQueryValue":"Judg.13.4-14","sourceRefExact":"Judg.13.4-14"},{"anchorText":"Prv 31:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.31.4","rawQueryValue":"Pr.31.4","sourceRefExact":"Pr.31.4"},{"anchorText":"Lk 1:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.1.15","rawQueryValue":"Luke.1.15","sourceRefExact":"Luke.1.15"},{"anchorText":"Proverbs 20:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.20.1","rawQueryValue":"Pr.20.1","sourceRefExact":"Pr.20.1"},{"anchorText":"Is 5:11, 22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.5.11,22","rawQueryValue":"Isa.5.11,22","sourceRefExact":"Isa.5.11,22"},{"anchorText":"Nm 28:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.28.7","rawQueryValue":"Num.28.7","sourceRefExact":"Num.28.7"},{"anchorText":"Dt 14:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.14.26","rawQueryValue":"Deut.14.26","sourceRefExact":"Deut.14.26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"ffbc8f820b895b03951b3baa0c4e105021ed9f137b37955dae53eeb4df7288a4","sourceItemName":"StrongDrink","sourceItemOrder":561,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"StrongDrink","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Strong Drink","title":"Strong Drink","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}